sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GM as Gmail
  participant PS as Google Pub/Sub
  participant W as Flask web
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Queue
  participant K as Worker

  GM->>PS: mailbox changed (email, historyId)
  PS->>W: POST /webhooks/google/pubsub + signed OIDC token
  W->>W: verify JWT signature, issuer, audience, service account, subscription
  W->>DB: account.pending_sync = true (durable)
  W->>Q: enqueue sync_account_history (coalesced)
  W-->>PS: 202 accepted (only after the DB commit)
  K->>Q: claim sync job
  K->>GM: history.list from last_history_id (all pages)
  alt checkpoint expired (404)
    K->>K: bounded re-index, fresh checkpoint
  else normal
    K->>DB: update changed threads - label-only changes do not re-run AI
    K->>DB: advance last_history_id, pending_sync = false
  end
  Note over K,DB: Every 5 min reconcile_pending_work re-enqueues anything pending (covers missed pushes and failed enqueues)
